body:
I was just going to suggest calling start after the widget has been mounted. Something seems to go wrong tick-wise with this set of tools together where you add a hierarchical widget and it seems like the `render` is called before the widget is added / before the result of its call is in. It can be solved by doing:

```
setTimeout(() => {
  search.start();
}, 0);
```

Note also you need to `preventDefault` the click on the event: https://codesandbox.io/s/svelte-forked-5e9d3?file=/hierarchical-list.svelte
